@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5055

### 1. Get All Students (GET)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/students
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Student by ID (GET)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create New Student (POST)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Zain Malik",
  "email": "zain.malik@example.com",
  "department": "Cyber Security",
  "phone": "+92 321 5556677",
  "enrollmentDate": "2024-09-01T00:00:00"
}

### 4. Update Student (PUT)
PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Muhammad Ali Khan",
  "email": "ali.khan@example.com",
  "department": "Computer Science & AI",
  "phone": "+92 300 1234567",
  "enrollmentDate": "2024-01-15T00:00:00"
}

### 5. Delete Student (DELETE)
DELETE {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/1
Accept: application/json
